  "solution": {
    "text": "At $t=0, t=\\frac{T}{2}$ and $t=T$ therelative velocity will bezero. At $t=\\frac{T}{4}$ and $t=\\frac{3 T}{4}$, the relative velocity will be maximum in magnitude\r\n\r\nHence graph (a) correctly depicts $v_{r}$ versus $t$ graph.",
